      value: ...Ok...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[9].DialougeToType
      value: The pair enter the priory and are greeted by the prioress who swiftly
        takes Robin Hood to be treated. Little John conforts the girl.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[10].DialougeToType
      value: Red Riding Hood is taken to a spare room to rest. Before though, she
        looks outside; and through the dark and snow, sees a bright light past by.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[11].DialougeToType
      value: A falling star... a big one
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[12].DialougeToType
      value: Red Riding Hood cries alone before going to sleep.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[13].DialougeToType
      value: The next day, christmas day, The girl wakes up to a quiet priory. The
        Huntsman having died the previous night, his friend bringing him to his grave.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[14].DialougeToType
      value: The prioress unexpectedly kicks the girl out of the piory. The girl
        is now left to fend for herself. Her kind nature unallowing for any wrong
        doings, thus leaving the bow and arrow behind.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[15].DialougeToType
      value: What happened next? Well...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[16].DialougeToType
      value: This story begins at the end of another.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[17].DialougeToType
      value: In the torturous winter of new years eve walked a young little girl
        in a worn down hood. All of its color faded in the cold. far from a home
        that doesn't exist anymore.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[18].DialougeToType
      value: The little girl had to feel the constant stabbing of the snow on her
        small, bare feet. Her shoes being stolen by some mean boys, who claim her
        shoes were too nice for a poor like her. Her mother made those shoes for
        here, what nice shoes they were.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[19].DialougeToType
      value: In an old basket, that use to hold cakes and wine for her family, now
        only held stale matches. She tried to sell them for any money that could
        help her out for one more day.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[20].DialougeToType
      value: Does anyone need matches for the winter,? A penny for a box!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[21].DialougeToType
      value: Anyone? Please?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[22].DialougeToType
      value: Not a single penny.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[23].DialougeToType
      value: The girl looked through one window, the light nearly blinded her. She
        watched as the people inside enjoyed a nice roasted goose under a warm fireplace
        and they laughed and sang with merry and joy.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[24].DialougeToType
      value: To shield the girl from the cold, she dragged herself between two houses
        and huddled down for the night.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[25].DialougeToType
      value: Her whole body felt like a thousand needles piercing her all over, yet
        she could do nothing to ease it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[26].DialougeToType
      value: Ah! Perhaps a burning match might be some good.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[27].DialougeToType
      value: Strike it against the wall... OH COME ONE! PLEASE!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[28].DialougeToType
      value: The girl manages to light a flame, a bright and holy flame. better than
        any fireplace. she imagines herself being surrounded by warmth for the first
        time in days.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[29].DialougeToType
      value: The girl imagines herself in a bright room with a bright christmas tree,
        with bright candles and a bright goose to be eaten.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[30].DialougeToType
      value: The girl ate to her hearts content then looks at all the light which
        looked like the stars of the night sky.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[31].DialougeToType
      value: The girl then noticed a falling star through the snow. She remembers
        her grandma who always told when a star falls, an angel would gain its wings
        to fly up to heaven.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[32].DialougeToType
      value: A person is getting their wings today...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[33].DialougeToType
      value: A person is dying today...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[34].DialougeToType
      value: The star reminds her of what happened
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[35].DialougeToType
      value: AAAAAAAAHHHHHHHH!!!!!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[36].DialougeToType
      value: The match burns out at the girl's fingertips, burning it a bit.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[37].DialougeToType
      value: The girl desperatley tries to light another match.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[38].DialougeToType
      value: Eventually she does. And this time a voice reaches out to her.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[39].DialougeToType
      value: (hello?)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[40].DialougeToType
      value: Hello dearie. How are you doing?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[41].DialougeToType
      value: GRANDMAAAA!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[42].DialougeToType
      value: Oh sweetie, don't cry. I'm here now.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[43].DialougeToType
      value: I'm so sorry grandma, it was all my fault this happened to you. I'm
        sorry I couldn't do anything.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[44].DialougeToType
      value: Oh No sweet child! you can't blame yourself. you are a free spirit now.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[45].DialougeToType
      value: Grandma! Oh please take me with you; I know you'll leave when this match
        burns out; like the tree, the goose the candles, the house.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[46].DialougeToType
      value: 'Oh, Come here pudding, Mom and Dad are waiting to celebrate new years!
        they were Oh so worried.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[47].DialougeToType
      value: '*sniff I''ve missed you.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[48].DialougeToType
      value: The Grandmother lifts the little girl into her arms, giving her a warm
        embrace. The girl was happy again.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[49].DialougeToType
      value: The evils of the world couldn't get her anymore. For she was with God.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[50].DialougeToType
      value: On the dawn of the new year layed a poor little girl; with pale cheeks
        and  the biggest smile anyone could give.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[51].DialougeToType
      value: '"Poor thing, she tried to warm herself" some said. not a single person
        gave her the dignity of a burial and left the cold corpse to sleep with the
        matches she clung on to.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[52].DialougeToType
      value: Yet that mattered not to the girl; for her story ends here absolutely;
        For no one could image what she went through, nor what she saw her final
        day.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[53].DialougeToType
      value: She died happy. A happy end for her.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[54].DialougeToType
      value: 'THE END.

        Game & Assets Made by ERROR_INTERVAL

        Sound
        Effects from FreeSound'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[55].DialougeToType
      value: The Grandmother lifts the little girl into her arms, giving her a warm
        embrace. The girl was happy again.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[56].DialougeToType
      value: The girl manages to light a flame, a bright and holy flame. better than
        any fireplace. she imagines herself being surrounded by warmth for the first
        time in days.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5513434127003781097, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: LevelLoaderScript
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 810433566}
